# Agent-readable text: the Markdown twin of each docs page (written by the
# theme's markdown integration), llms.txt and llms-full.txt.
#
# Production (labs-browserpod) is served from its root behind browserpod.io's
# /docs/* proxy; previews serve under /docs/. So the named files are listed for
# both, as in _redirects. The /*.md rule matches either way.
/*.md
	Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
/llms.txt
	Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
/llms-full.txt
	Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
/docs/llms.txt
	Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
/docs/llms-full.txt
	Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
